script = ExtResource("1_nt")
menu_title = "Final Thaw"
menu_context = "The Ghost Protocol · playable demo (Phases 1 and 2, about 30 minutes)
Helix claims the last trial of Aster, the protocol meant to stabilise the regional climate, failed. Elena Vast, the scientist who co-designed it, does not believe it. Tonight she slips alone into Helix's hydrological facility to check: measure, deduce and leave without a trace."
